        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234270/extras/ca93e49eb26686b6633038985ce8bca6.avif?t=1778821120\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234270/extras_big/ca93e49eb26686b6633038985ce8bca6.webp?t=1778821120 width=1560 height=225 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare for a mind-bending arcade challenge.</strong> <br><strong>Yin Yang Fun</strong> takes the classic falling-block formula and turns it inside out: instead of controlling one grid, you must command <strong>two independent boards at the same time</strong>. Two hands, two rhythms, one brain-melting test of coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the speed rises, your focus will be stretched to its limit. Can you keep both sides alive, clear lines under pressure, and stay in harmony before everything collapses?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If it took twenty years to master the old challenge… <br><strong>will it take forty to conquer this one?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It took 40 years to overcome the previous challenge. Will it take 80 years to overcome this one?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two Hands, Two Grids. Back in Block again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234270/extras/aa7a0da776c79f76a1dbe141ff9f5e23.avif?t=1778821120\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234270/extras_big/aa7a0da776c79f76a1dbe141ff9f5e23.webp?t=1778821120 width=1560 height=138 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Grid System</strong> — Control left and right boards simultaneously. A pure multitasking challenge. <br><strong>Campaign Mode</strong> — 20 handcrafted stages with increasing difficulty. <br><strong>Endless Mode</strong> — Push your limits and chase your best score in local leaderboards. <br> <br><strong>Full Controller Support</strong> — Play comfortably with either keyboard or gamepad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234270/extras/8d5b43d839ffd754751a5aded63d7fac.avif?t=1778821120\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234270/extras/ca93e49eb26686b6633038985ce8bca6.avif?t=1778821120\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234270/extras_big/ca93e49eb26686b6633038985ce8bca6.webp?t=1778821120 width=1560 height=225 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare for a mind-bending arcade challenge.</strong> <br><strong>Yin Yang Fun</strong> takes the classic falling-block formula and turns it inside out: instead of controlling one grid, you must command <strong>two independent boards at the same time</strong>. Two hands, two rhythms, one brain-melting test of coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the speed rises, your focus will be stretched to its limit. Can you keep both sides alive, clear lines under pressure, and stay in harmony before everything collapses?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If it took twenty years to master the old challenge… <br><strong>will it take forty to conquer this one?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It took 40 years to overcome the previous challenge. Will it take 80 years to overcome this one?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two Hands, Two Grids. Back in Block again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234270/extras/aa7a0da776c79f76a1dbe141ff9f5e23.avif?t=1778821120\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234270/extras_big/aa7a0da776c79f76a1dbe141ff9f5e23.webp?t=1778821120 width=1560 height=138 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Grid System</strong> — Control left and right boards simultaneously. A pure multitasking challenge. <br><strong>Campaign Mode</strong> — 20 handcrafted stages with increasing difficulty. <br><strong>Endless Mode</strong> — Push your limits and chase your best score in local leaderboards. <br> <br><strong>Full Controller Support</strong> — Play comfortably with either keyboard or gamepad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234270/extras/8d5b43d839ffd754751a5aded63d7fac.avif?t=1778821120\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Test your reflexes and multitasking skills in this unique arcade block-puzzler. Control two grids at once, clear lines on both sides, keep up with the rising speed, and chase the high score. Two hands, two grids… back in block again!",
